<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SafeConnect</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      color: #222;
    }

    .app {
      max-width: 430px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: auto;
      background: white;
    }

    header {
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      padding: 25px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 30px;
    }

    header p {
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: #ccc;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 25px 20px;
    }

    .welcome {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .welcome h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #fafafa;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .button {
      width: 100%;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 10px;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
    }

    .button.secondary {
      background: white;
      color: #111;
      border: 1px solid #111;
    }

    .safety {
      border-left: 5px solid #111;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="app">

  <header>
    <h1>SafeConnect</h1>
    <p>Connect. Meet. Stay Safe.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="content">

    <div class="welcome">
      <h2>Welcome to SafeConnect</h2>
      <p>A dating and social connection platform built around identity and safety.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🪪 Verified Identity</h3>
      <p>Users will verify their identity before accessing the full platform.</p>
      <button class="button">Verify My Identity</button>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>❤️ Find Your Connection</h3>
      <p>Discover people based on interests, hobbies and preferences.</p>
      <button class="button">Discover People</button>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>💬 Messages</h3>
      <p>Chat with your matches through the SafeConnect messaging system.</p>
      <button class="button secondary">Open Messages</button>
    </div>

